 "title": "Set up by kind",
 "caption": "It stands in a rail, the navigation and the content attached, at the body's full width: the rail stands shut to its icons, and on a phone one bar stands at the top. The page level holds the title of the page. Every kind is shown, connected or not, as a card widget, in one container. The title of a card is the kind, with the icon of that kind before it. Under it stands the provider: its name, and on the line under the name its state and a fact. Only its actions stand at the end of the line. A kind with no provider yet says so and offers Connect. Three across at a desktop, two across on a tablet and one under another on a phone, with the kinds in use first. Every screen shows every kind.",
